    "title": "'Age Of Attraction' Sheds Light On Nick Viall And Natalie Joy's Age Difference: How Old Are They?",
    "text": "Published March 11, 2026, 9:00 a.m. ET ‘Ladies Of London: The New Reign’ Star Mark-Francis Vandelli Teases Drama With Margo Stilley0 seconds of 0 secondsVolume 0%Loading ad00:2500:0007:00 Where to Stream: Age of Attraction Where to Watch Widget Failed To Load. Please Try Again. Powered by Reelgood Nick Viall and Natalie Joy are following in Nick Lachey and Vanessa Lachey‘s footsteps as the next married co-hosts of a Netflix dating series. Age of Attraction, which landed on the streamer today, is like Love is Blind, but instead of not being able to see the other person face-to-face, the contestants aren’t allowed to know the ages of their potential matches. So, is age just a number? For Viall and Joy it is. The two have a nearly 20-year age gap, making them the perfect couple to guide these singles through Age of Attraction. In the show, the contestants range from their early 20s to their early 60s, and they aren’t allowed to reveal their true ages until a commitment is made. Whether or not they will stand the test of time (or this experiment) will depend on their compatibility, their ability to throw age out the window, and whether their loved ones approve of their newfound matches. Viall and Joy, for their part, are often in the pop culture conversation as co-hosts of the Viall Files podcast. Viall, previously a star on The Bachelor, has also hosted a Secret Lives of Mormon Wives reunion, while Joy is a certified surgical technologist. According to Viall, he initially had “reservations” about pursuing a relationship with a much-younger Joy, who was “far less worried about others’ opinions” in regard to their age gap. If you’re wondering how old they actually are, we see you and we hear you. Keep reading for everything we know! How old are Nick Viall and Natalie Joy? What is their age difference? Nick Viall and Natalie Joy have an 18-year age difference. As of the time of this writing, Viall is 45 years old (born in 1980) and Joy is 27 years old (born in 1998). They began dating in 2020 when Joy, then 22 years old, slid into Viall’s, then 40 years old, DMs. They tied the knot in 2024 at her family’s farm in Georgia. “A modern-day love story,” Joy says in Age of Attraction. Is Natalie Joy pregnant? Yes! Joy is currently pregnant with twin girls, their second and third babies. The podcaster gave birth to their first daughter, River Rose Viall, in February 2024. Photo: Getty Images How to watch Age of Attraction: Age of Attraction is currently streaming on Netflix. The next part drops on Wednesday, March 18, and the final episodes will be released on Wednesday, March 25. You can subscribe to the platform for as low as $7.99 per month with ads or $17.99 per month without ads. Tags Age of Attraction Netflix nick viall",
